do those things where people are

00:00:03.070 --> 00:00:05.471
like, "Oh, you're nice and
you really like your fans."

00:00:05.471 --> 00:00:08.108
I'm like, "Yes,
what's the alternative?"

00:00:08.108 --> 00:00:09.576
They're like, 
"Oh, everybody else."

00:00:09.576 --> 00:00:11.234
And it just so crazy to me.

00:00:11.234 --> 00:00:14.240
It's crazy to me,
please, so many of you,

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:15.482
so many of you, 
that's not true.

00:00:15.482 --> 00:00:18.418
A couple of you
are gonna break out,

00:00:18.418 --> 00:00:23.624
follow this blueprint,
win, become something.

00:00:23.624 --> 00:00:25.626
Have people admire
you and care about you,

00:00:25.626 --> 00:00:27.628
want to take a selfie,
want to get the book signed.

00:00:27.628 --> 00:00:29.329
Please, please don't become that

00:00:29.329 --> 00:00:31.565
person that ever 
takes it for granted.

00:00:31.565 --> 00:00:33.133
Remember where you came from.

00:00:33.133 --> 00:00:34.968
Remember where you came from.

00:00:34.968 --> 00:00:36.103
It really matters.

00:00:36.103 --> 00:00:40.540
Never, never ever lose that
gratitude of another even if you

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:42.549
have four people
following you right now.

00:00:42.549 --> 00:00:45.562
Never lose the
gratitude for those four.

00:00:45.562 --> 00:00:47.501
And I think it's very easy and

00:00:47.501 --> 00:00:50.083
so that's kind of a
memorable moment, DRock.

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:53.143
How many people wanted to be
in line after watching me talk

00:00:53.143 --> 00:00:56.556
